# I18n Dictionaries

- Keep locale dictionaries modular by feature namespace instead of growing
  `en.ts` and `nl.ts` into monoliths.
- Store locale-specific translation slices under per-locale folders like
  `src/i18n/dictionaries/en/` and `src/i18n/dictionaries/nl/`.
- Treat `src/i18n/dictionaries/en.ts` and `src/i18n/dictionaries/nl.ts` as
  composition files that assemble the locale from namespaced imports.
- Use the same export name per namespace in each locale file, for example
  `src/i18n/dictionaries/en/auth.ts` and `src/i18n/dictionaries/nl/auth.ts`
  should both export `auth`.

```ts
import { auth } from "./en/auth";

const en = {
  auth,
};
```
